                    <li class="flex gap-3.5 items-start bg-black/30 p-3.5 rounded-xl border border-white/5">
                        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-amber-400 text-xl flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">balance</span>
                        <div><strong class="text-amber-200 block mb-0.5 font-semibold">1. Precision Weight &amp; Dimensions</strong> Counterfeits often use wrong alloys leading to incorrect gram weight or thickness compared to official mint specifications. Always use a calibrated digital micro-scale.</div>
                    </li>
